{"completed": true, "response": "<WritingBlock id=\"58321\" variant=\"standard\">他并不觉得两个人现在的关系不够亲近，因为这段相处已经让他感到温暖和安心，所以他不急着让关系有个结果。其实，他早就想好要向对方说什么，并不是一时冲动。越是享受现在的相处，他就越想把心里话说出来，但他也知道，一旦说出口，两个人的关系可能就会发生变化，而这正是他不想轻易失去的。所以，他既没法因为现在过得很好就不再想这件事，也不愿为了说出心里话而贸然改变现状。此刻，他并没有做出新的决定，也不是开始怀疑对方，或觉得现在的关系不好，只是他既想说出心里话，又想珍惜眼前的相处，这两种想法一直都在，还没有找到解决的办法。</WritingBlock>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3b3c9756-bb93-4183-a779-6f90b02f62f1", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T003138946216Z", "elapsed_seconds": 8.641, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T00:31:47.588985+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b3f5b1fb736faa8af77bbb950bb7139e0663ae370caa22a523e3422284f1ee82", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "d